# v1.0.1

## Features
[feature] Pick a third-party app on the phone, start it, and watch PID-scoped logcat with ANR badges
[feature] Ask DeepSeek to diagnose an ANR from capped traces, with Settings key save/test and follow-up Q&A
[feature] Diagnose walks scan → dumpsys → bugreport → parse → Perfetto in one run, then shows stat cards, an expandable ANR stack, Perfetto findings with Open in Perfetto UI, and Markdown/JSON export

## Improvements
[improvement] Home lists USB-debugging phones over adb and can watch logcat for ANRs
[improvement] Pull an adb bugreport, unzip it, and parse ANR traces plus quick dumpsys gfx/mem/cpu snapshots
[improvement] Capture a 10s Perfetto trace over adb and summarize jank with trace_processor

